Description: Driverless printing and scanning manager (UOS 20)
 A native DTK5 / Qt5 application that manages driverless (IPP-USB)
 printing and scanning: environment detection with repair guidance,
 printer queue management with PPD fine-tuning, SANE/eSCL scanning
 with preview, and advanced per-device filtering that lets a device
 keep driverless printing while its scanning is handed back to the
 vendor's native SANE driver.
 .
 This build targets UOS 20 (Qt 5.11 + DTK 5.6).
 For deepin 25 / UOS 25 (Qt 6 + DTK 6) use the debian/ metadata.
